### Send a new activity log — LOGIN
POST http://localhost:3000/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "kemo",
  "action": "LOGIN",
  "metadata": {
    "browser": "Chrome",
    "ip": "192.168.1.1"
  }
}

###

### Send another log — PAGE_VIEW
POST http://localhost:3000/api/logs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "user456",
  "action": "PAGE_VIEW",
  "metadata": {
    "page": "/dashboard"
  }
}

###

### Get all logs (paginated)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/logs

###

### Get logs filtered by userId
GET http://localhost:3000/api/logs?userId=kemo

###

### Get logs filtered by action
GET http://localhost:3000/api/logs?action=LOGIN&page=1&limit=5

###

### Get logs by date range
GET http://localhost:3000/api/logs?startDate=2024-01-01&endDate=2026-12-31

###

### Health check
GET http://localhost:3000/health